Conformance vectors
-------------------

  Resources/vectors.json

  Vendored verbatim from the DeepSeek peak/off-peak conformance suite:

      https://github.com/xyzs996/deepseek-peak-hours
      deepseek-peak-offpeak-vectors.json

  Licence: CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain Dedication)
           https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

  The suite is used unmodified as the app's conformance corpus: 15 phase
  vectors, 3 next-boundary vectors, and the two schedule configurations the
  config checks validate.  The vectors are test fixtures and are not shipped
  in the application bundle.

Holiday calendar snapshot
-------------------------

  Resources/cn_zh.ics

  A point-in-time snapshot of Apple's China holiday calendar, retrieved from:

      https://calendars.icloud.com/holidays/cn_zh.ics

  It is used only as an offline, deterministic test fixture for the iCalendar
  parser and is not shipped in the application bundle.

Statutory holiday data
----------------------

  Resources/holidays-2026.json

  Derived from the State Council of the People's Republic of China's 2026
  public holiday arrangement, 国办发明电〔2025〕7号.  Government notices of
  this kind are not subject to copyright.

